      "id": "a7f72223-83a8-4c11-9ed4-643fe54c04f6",
      "content": "English: Lo-Ammi | French: Lo-Ammi | Latin: Non populus meus | Origin: &#1500;&#1488;&#1465;&#1506;&#1463;&#1502;&#1468;&#1460;&#1497; | Vietnamese: Lô Am-mi -- Hs 1,9",
